# Workflow YAML must stay LF.
#
# Both files under .github/workflows were authored with LF. A tool once rewrote
# installer.yml as CRLF while making a 3-line edit, which turned the diff into
# +1173/-1173 across a 1171-line file and hid the real change from review
# (82d105c, reverted in 980b924). Pinning eol here makes Git normalise on commit
# so that cannot happen silently again.
*.yml   text eol=lf
*.yaml  text eol=lf

# Deliberately NO `* text=auto` catch-all: this repo tracks binaries (.exe, .dll,
# .sqlite, .png, .gha) and a blanket text rule risks corrupting them on checkout.